{
  "uid": "home",
  "title": "Home",
  "description": "Is anything wrong, and is data arriving? Every service's request rate, errors and p95 with its monitors' status, the monitors that are triggered, and ozymandias watching its own intake.",
  "widgets": [
    {
      "id": "intro",
      "type": "note",
      "layout": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 2
      },
      "markdown": "Service cards come from the APM tables (every request, before trace sampling); a card's dot is the worst status, in that card's env, of the monitors tagged service:<name>, and is always now, whatever the window. Ingest health below is ozymandias watching itself through the same intake an agent's series take: if it is empty, the pipeline is down, not the dashboard."
    },
    {
      "id": "services",
      "type": "service_summary",
      "title": "Services",
      "layout": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 2,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 5
      },
      "limit": 12
    },
    {
      "id": "triggered",
      "type": "monitor_summary",
      "title": "Triggered monitors",
      "layout": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 7,
        "w": 6,
        "h": 3
      },
      "monitor_filter": {
        "status": [
          "ALERT",
          "WARN",
          "NO_DATA"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "points",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Points stored",
      "layout": {
        "x": 6,
        "y": 7,
        "w": 6,
        "h": 3
      },
      "queries": [
        {
          "q": "sum:ozy.intake.points_accepted{*}.as_rate()",
          "display": "area"
        }
      ],
      "yaxis": {
        "min": 0,
        "unit": "points/s"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "rejected",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Series refused",
      "layout": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 10,
        "w": 6,
        "h": 3
      },
      "queries": [
        {
          "q": "sum:ozy.intake.series_rejected{*}.as_rate()",
          "display": "bars"
        }
      ],
      "yaxis": {
        "min": 0,
        "unit": "series/s"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "sketches",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Sketches stored",
      "layout": {
        "x": 6,
        "y": 10,
        "w": 6,
        "h": 3
      },
      "queries": [
        {
          "q": "sum:ozy.intake.sketch_points_accepted{*}.as_rate()",
          "display": "line"
        }
      ],
      "yaxis": {
        "min": 0,
        "unit": "sketches/s"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "series",
      "type": "query_value",
      "title": "Series in the store",
      "layout": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 13,
        "w": 4,
        "h": 2
      },
      "queries": [
        {
          "q": "max:ozy.store.series{*}",
          "reducer": "last"
        }
      ],
      "precision": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "head",
      "type": "query_value",
      "title": "Series in the head",
      "layout": {
        "x": 4,
        "y": 13,
        "w": 4,
        "h": 2
      },
      "queries": [
        {
          "q": "max:ozy.tsdb.head.series{*}",
          "reducer": "last"
        }
      ],
      "precision": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "disk",
      "type": "query_value",
      "title": "Store on disk (bytes)",
      "layout": {
        "x": 8,
        "y": 13,
        "w": 4,
        "h": 2
      },
      "queries": [
        {
          "q": "max:ozy.tsdb.disk_bytes{*}",
          "reducer": "last"
        }
      ],
      "precision": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "per-agent",
      "type": "toplist",
      "title": "Series sent, by agent",
      "layout": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 15,
        "w": 6,
        "h": 3
      },
      "queries": [
        {
          "q": "sum:ozy.agent.forwarder.series_sent{*} by {host}.as_rate()",
          "reducer": "avg"
        }
      ],
      "limit": 10
    }
  ]
}
